## 🎯 Objectives
1. Build a fully functional frontend using vanilla JavaScript and Vite
2. Integrate Supabase for backend database and authentication
3. Implement secure user access with role-based permissions
4. Perform CRUD operations on student records
5. Generate simple reports using SQL functions

